<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>West Leg Trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:124-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.301623" lon="-121.742635"><ele>1217.6</ele><name>Mazama Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:mazama-sno-park (OSM way 149083303); confidence: high; pdf_page: 126; quote: Starting from Mazama Sno-Park opposite the Timberline Lodge road, cross the highway to the north side</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.301574" lon="-121.741207"><ele>1216.3</ele><name>West Leg Road leaves Highway 26</name><desc>source: south end of USFS road 2645000 HISTORIC WESTLEG RD. (EDW RoadCore); confidence: high; pdf_page: 126; quote: walk up a narrow plowed road 100 yards west of the Timberline junction. Go 50 yards up this side road, then climb the snowbank to the left onto the West Leg Trail</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.325121" lon="-121.711085"><ele>1722.1</ele><name>Top of the West Leg Road</name><desc>source: north end of USFS road 2645000 (EDW RoadCore); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 127; quote: leave the West Leg just above the last switchback, on a marked Nordic trail about 0.5 mile from Timberline Lodge</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.330659" lon="-121.709056"><ele>1796.0</ele><name>Timberline Lodge parking (sno-park C)</name><desc>source: OSM node at the top end of Timberline Highway way 44164309, east of the lodge; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 127; quote: map 27: the West Leg bends east below the lodge and joins at sno-park C</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.331100" lon="-121.711200"><ele>1812.1</ele><name>Timberline Lodge</name><desc>source: OSM way 149173768 Timberline Lodge (hotel); confidence: high; pdf_page: 127; book_elev_ft: 5950; quote: map 27: TIMBERLINE LODGE 5950'</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>West Leg Trail</name><desc>1. Mazama Sno-Park -&gt; West Leg Road leaves Highway 26: straight (high), 0.07 mi | 2. West Leg Road leaves Highway 26 -&gt; Top of the West Leg Road: usfs-road (high), 5.14 mi | 3. Top of the West Leg Road -&gt; Timberline Lodge parking (sno-park C): osm (medium), 0.45 mi | 4. Timberline Lodge parking (sno-park C) -&gt; Timberline Lodge: straight (medium), 0.11 mi</desc>
